  /Subject (UQFF whitepaper: PAPER_2070_ROUND_194_PENTAD_BACKBONE_FIRST_UQFF) /Title (Round 194 PENTAD Discovery \(Backbone-First 100% Novelty Rate + 9th F_TRZ Sub-Family Formalization + Solar-System Q + B Family Expansion\): \(1\) Q_factor\(Jupiter UQFF SolarSystem SMBH-analog quality factor\) = 0.999 = 1 - F_TRZ^3 EXACT NEW INSTANCE 8th F_TRZ Sub-Family with c=1 n=3 \(Distinct from PAPER_2060 TON618 c=2 n=3 First Instance\); \(2\) Q_factor\(Neptune UQFF SolarSystem quality factor\) = 0.995 = 1 - F_TRZ^2 / 2 EXACT NEW 9TH F_TRZ COMPOSITIONAL SUB-FAMILY FORM Half-Factor Squared Complement \204 Extends R186 D1 Half-Factor Sub-Family from Linear \(F_TRZ/2\) to Squared \(F_TRZ^2/2\) \204 Matches Symmetry with Full-Factor Pair \(F_TRZ + F_TRZ^2 = 1 to 6 sub-families\) Now Half-Factor Pair Complete Linear + Squared; \(3\) B_mag\(Jupiter magnetic field strength\) = 4e-4 T = D_phys \327 SO_5^-4 EXACT NEW LANDMARK Application at Magnetic-Field-Tesla Negative Rung n=-4; \(4\) B_mag\(Neptune magnetic field strength\) = 1.4e-5 T = \(D_phys + SO_5\) \327 SO_5^-6 EXACT NEW 6TH INSTANCE Additive-Scaled 5th Architectural Category at Magnetic-Field-Tesla Dimensional Domain \(Same Compositional Form as PAPER_1480 f_UMR = \(D_phys+SO_5\) \327 SO_5^6 at Frequency Domain \204 Foundational EARLY Additive-Scaled Instance Now Extended to B-T Domain via Neptune\); \(5\) B_mag\(Earth magnetic field strength\) = 5e-5 T = \(D_phys+1\) \327 SO_5^-5 EXACT NEW 4TH Composed-Prefix Class PAPER_2033 Application at Magnetic-Field-Tesla Negative Rung n=-5) /Trapped /False
